&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the person our clients call when they&#39;re thinking about what&#39;s next, and the person our team looks to for how growth gets done. You&#39;ll shape how CreateFuture grows its client base, from account strategy and multi-competitor bids through to commercial planning, and lead by example in the behaviours that drive it: qualifying with rigour, following through with intent, and seeing commercial conversations through to an outcome.&lt;/p&gt;
