&lt;li&gt;Leading, coaching and developing a team of Lead Client Partners and Client Partners, raising the whole team&#39;s capability in consultative selling, stakeholder strategy and commercial qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading CreateFuture&#39;s approach to large, complex and multi-competitor bids, shaping value propositions, particularly across AI, data and modern digital delivery, that position us as the partner of choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting the operational rhythm across multiple portfolios: holding a 3x pipeline standard, driving forecast accuracy and high-quality Statements of Work, and owning your contribution to annual financial targets and wider commercial planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Championing strategic account planning and Client Partnership Groups (CPGs), aligning delivery teams to client expectations, using client satisfaction as a lever for growth, and raising CreateFuture&#39;s profile through events, content and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
