&lt;li&gt;Bring real credibility on AI and technology: you can hold a commercially grounded conversation with a CTO, CDO or CEO about agentic AI, data, cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, Google Cloud) and modern software delivery, and have successfully positioned AI-related propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
